  "title": "Cherry Cream Cheese Cake",
  "description": "This luscious pound cake has a nutty top crust, and is moist and flavorful. Makes a great gift. You can use halved maraschino cherries instead, if you prefer.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-06-13T14:25:51-04:00",
